  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Family photograph
  Body: 'A FAMILY OF FOUR


    The mother''s face has been rubbed away while the
    other three remain clear. Under the frame: ''Don''t put her chair away. She still
    comes home.''


    The empty place is laid for supper. The chair faces the doorway,
    as if someone is expected.'
